🖧 2. Access Switch (2960-24TT — Port Access, Security, DHCP Snooping & DAI)
Plaintext
enable
configure terminal

! 🏷️ Identitas & Banner
hostname SW-ACCESS-2960
banner motd # 🛑 Akses Terbatas: SW-ACCESS-2960 (Access Layer Security) 🛑 #

! 🌐 Sinkronisasi Database VLAN
vlan 10
name IT-DEPT
vlan 20
name HR-DEPT
vlan 30
name FINANCE-DEPT
vlan 40
name GUEST-ZONE
vlan 99
name MANAGEMENT
exit

! 🔌 Trunk Uplink ke Multilayer Switch
interface GigabitEthernet 0/1
description Uplink ke SW-CORE-3560
switchport mode trunk
switchport trunk native vlan 99
ip dhcp snooping trust
no shutdown
exit

! 💻 Pemetaan Port Access Sesuai Topologi
interface FastEthernet 0/2
description PC-HR (VLAN 20)
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 20
exit

interface FastEthernet 0/3
description PC-FINANCE (VLAN 30)
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 30
exit

interface FastEthernet 0/4
description Laptop-IT (VLAN 10)
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 10
exit

interface FastEthernet 0/5
description PC-GUEST (VLAN 40)
switchport mode access
switchport access vlan 40
exit

! 🔒 Port Security (Sticky MAC + Shutdown) pada Port End-Device
interface range FastEthernet 0/2 - 5
switchport port-security
switchport port-security maximum 2
switchport port-security mac-address sticky
switchport port-security violation shutdown
no shutdown
exit

! 🛡️ DHCP Snooping & Dynamic ARP Inspection (DAI)
ip dhcp snooping
ip dhcp snooping vlan 10,20,30,40
ip arp inspection vlan 10,20,30,40

interface range FastEthernet 0/2 - 5
ip dhcp snooping limit rate 15
exit

end
write memory
🔍 Cek cepat di SW-ACCESS-2960:

show interfaces trunk — pastikan trunk Gi0/1 aktif dan native VLAN 99 terpasang.

show port-security — pastikan status port aktif (Secure-up) dan sticky MAC tersimpan.

show ip dhcp snooping binding — cek daftar IP dan MAC yang valid.
